   <crs:Description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">SNIPED proof batch v1. For volume Proof tier (3-star frames). Lighter version of locked-look: less aggressive curve (shadows +3 / darks -2 / lights -2 / highlights -5), sharpening 30, clarity +5 + vibrance +5 for thumbnail-tier pop. Apply via batch synchronize on all 3-star frames after star pass.</rdf:li>
